# The fonts of the getting-started page's program, as its main/CMakeLists.txt asks for them: the number large, of its
# digits alone; the other texts of every letter of its main.c, here of picture_start.c, which holds the same code.
rules fonts.rules
need large
size 32px
bits 4
letters 0123456789
need body
size 13px
bits 4
text picture_start.c
